## Build

```powershell
typst compile main.typ        # writes main.pdf
typst watch main.typ          # rebuild on save
```

Typst cannot read files outside this folder, so citations come from the local `references.bib`. In Zotero, right-click this project's collection, **Export Collection...**, format **Better BibLaTeX**, tick **Keep updated**, and save it as this folder's `references.bib`.
